      "title": "Agreed order form",
      "text": "Seller: Mavuno Crest Coffee, Kenya\nBuyer: Liora Venn, France\nOrder: single-origin coffee beans\n\nRequirements:\n- Supply 10 kg of whole-bean coffee from Nyeri, Kenya.\n- Pack the coffee in ten sealed 1 kg bags.\n- Include a roast-date label on every bag.\n- Include a printed brewing guide in the parcel.\n\nAgreed price: EUR 240, including shipping.\nPayment method: PayPal.\nThe buyer confirmed the requirements before payment. The coffee is intended for retail sampling, so the bags should remain sealed during transport. The seller will dispatch the parcel to the delivery details supplied privately by the buyer."
    },
