      "title": "Parcel handover note",
      "text": "Mavuno Crest Coffee dispatch note\n\nCarrier: DHL Express\nTracking: JD7K4M2P9Q6R\nContents checked before sealing: 10 kg of whole-bean coffee from Nyeri, Kenya, packed in ten sealed 1 kg bags. Six bags have roast-date labels; four do not. The printed brewing guide was not included in the parcel.\n\nThe parcel was handed to the carrier in Nairobi. The seller sent the buyer the tracking details and a copy of this contents check. The bags were sealed and placed together in one outer carton, with packing material around them. No other item was listed inside the carton."
    },
    {
      "title": "Buyer-seller chat after delivery",
      "text": "10:14 Liora: The parcel arrived today. I checked the bags against your note.\n10:18 Sela, Mavuno Crest Coffee: Thanks for checking. Were they intact?\n10:21 Liora: Yes, all ten bags were sealed. The coffee and origin match the order.\n10:23 Liora: I can also confirm six roast-date labels and four bags without them. There was no printed brewing guide in the box.\n10:27 Sela: Sorry about those omissions. I can send the missing date information and arrange a guide separately.\n10:31 Liora: Please send the dates first. I will let you know whether a separate guide is useful."
    }
